      "review_description": "I couldn’t have been more pleased with the EV charger installation service! From start to finish, the process was seamless and professional. Michael arrived on time, assessed my needs, and provided expert advice on the best location for the charger. He was incredibly knowledgeable and took the time to explain the installation process and answer any of my questions.His workmanship was faultless, and he ensured that everything was done to the highest standard. I also appreciated how clean and organized he was, leaving the area spotless after completing the job.His pricing was very competitive and I can highly recommend his services to anyone looking to install an EV charger. Truly a 5-star experience!Even after the job was completed and money was exchanged, Michael took the time to follow up with me and ensure that everything was working as required, a rare site with modern day tradies!",
