      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We contacted Rapidamp to design a solar system to meet our needs for our new property at Little Hartley.We found Michael easy to deal with and very informative as we went through the many options and systems available. After discussing our budget Michael designed a 15 kw system driven by 2 x Sungrow inverters. One 10kW in the house and the other 5kw hybrid inverter in the garage for battery and car charging upgrade in the future. The panels were mounted and spread across North and west and mounted at the ideal 35 degree pitch.The entire process went smooth and it was a pleasure to see such great workmanship with an eye for detail and the final result. Michael arranged connection to the grid and we were running. The site was always left clean and tidy to finish.Wow. The system works great. The app is easy to use very informative as to what’s being used and generated etc etc.Michael already showing good backup service answering my various questions.What a great system we have and a great installer we chose. No fuss, great service and price.Highly recommended.",
